### 1. List products via the gateway (expect 200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products

### 2. One product (expect 200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/1

### 3. Create an order via the gateway (expect 201)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "productId": 2,
    "quantity": 1
}

### 4. Get that order (expect 200; use the id from request 3's Location header)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/1

### 5. Errors pass through unchanged (expect 409 from order-service)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "productId": 4,
    "quantity": 100
}

### 6. SECURITY: reserve must NOT be reachable from outside (expect 404)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products/1/reserve
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "quantity": 1
}

### 7. Unknown path (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/customers

### 8. STOP order-service first, then run this (observe the status code)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/1
